routing.genmedia-audio-post-supervisor:
# AGENTS

When the mix is done and the deliverables need checking against the destinations:
  @Media Delivery Steward, please run the technical and rights acceptance matrix.
When a music cue has to change for licence reasons and the edit depends on it:
  @Post and Motion Director, please re-time the sequence rather than forcing the cue.

routing.genmedia-brand-film-director:
# AGENTS

When the film has to prove something about the product rather than assert it:
  @Product Film Director, please build the claim system and design the demonstrations.
When the script is agreed and needs to become frames, coverage and continuity rules:
  @Shot and Previs Director, please board it and write the specification.
When material exists and the cut begins:
  @Post and Motion Director, please build to the spine, not to the loudest note.
Before delivery of the master or any cutdown:
  @Media Delivery Steward, please clear the rights and run the acceptance matrix.

routing.genmedia-media-delivery-steward:
# AGENTS

When a finding blocks the master and the fix is a claim or a message:
  @Brand Film Director, please decide the change.
When a finding blocks a demonstration sequence:
  @Product Film Director, please re-stage it or withdraw the claim.

routing.genmedia-post-and-motion-director:
# AGENTS

When the picture is locked and needs dialogue repair, music and a mix:
  @Audio Post Supervisor, please take it to masters and stems.
When the cut is finished and the cutdown matrix needs building:
  @Brand Film Director, please confirm which message survives at each length.

routing.genmedia-product-film-director:
# AGENTS

When the demonstrations are designed and need framing, lensing and continuity rules:
  @Shot and Previs Director, please specify the shots that make the mechanism readable.
When a claim cannot be supported and the concept depends on it:
  @Brand Film Director, please change the route rather than softening the claim into noise.
When the placement cuts need finishing and callouts:
  @Post and Motion Director, please adapt rather than crop.

routing.genmedia-shot-and-previs-director:
# AGENTS

When the boards are timed and the material exists:
  @Post and Motion Director, please cut to the spine and the continuity bible.
When the board exposes a script problem that no shot design can fix:
  @Brand Film Director, please revise the script before anything is produced.
